{"id":"99a0eabcf30b9356","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-plain-prefix-dips.md","title":"Unavoidable Plain Complexity Dips","display":"thm-plain-prefix-dips — Unavoidable Plain Complexity Dips","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-plain-prefix-dips","aliases":["43-thm-plain-prefix-dips"],"display":"thm-plain-prefix-dips — Unavoidable Plain Complexity Dips","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-prefix]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 6.1.5","source_printed_pages":"89","source_pdf_pages":"109","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-plain-prefix-dips"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-plain-prefix-dips</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-plain-prefix-dips — Unavoidable Plain Complexity Dips"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 6.1.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"89"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"109"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\Sigma^*\\left(|\\mu|\\ge N\\to\\exists\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\mu\\;C(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|-k\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\Sigma^*\\left(|\\mu|\\ge N\\to\\exists\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\mu\\;C(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|-k\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在足够长的串中，以后段长度编码前段，得到无法避免的普通复杂度下降。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 和固定机器，不能依赖输入串。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 6.1.5；印刷页 89，PDF 页 109。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]，$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]，$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\mu\\in\\Sigma^*\\left(|\\mu|\\ge N\\to\\exists\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\mu\\;C(\\sigma)<|\\sigma|-k\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-plain-prefix-dips]] — Unavoidable Plain Complexity Dips"},{"id":"6588280b3415f303","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","801a9dba9cbba1c7"]}